<title>QATAR: TENNIS-DAVIS CUP ASIA/OCEANIA ZONE THREE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DAVIS CUP ASIA/OCEANIA ZONE THREE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DOHA 1997-03-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of final round-robin</p>
<p>matches in the Davis Cup tennis Asia/Oceania zone three</p>
<p>tournament on Sunday:</p>
<p>Malaysia beat Sri Lanka 3-0</p>
<p>Results (Malaysian names first):</p>
<p>Vasuthevan Ortchuan beat Lahiru Loshan Jayasuriya 6-4  7-6</p>
<p>(7-3)</p>
<p>Ramaiah Ramachandran beat Mohamed Roshun Razik 6-1 6-1</p>
<p>Jamal Mulyadi/Abdul Aziz Shazali beat Samantha Rohan</p>
<p>DeSilva/Jayendra Wijeyasekera 4-6 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Bahrain beat Bangladesh 2-1</p>
<p>Results (Bahraini names first):</p>
<p>Esam Jaafar Ali Abdulaal beat Dilip Passia 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>Abdul-Rahman Shehab lost to Shovon Jamaly 1-6 4-6</p>
<p>Shehab Rashid Ahmed/Nader-Jaafar Ali Abdul Aal beat Shovon</p>
<p>Jamaly/Dilip Passia 6-2 1-6 6-4</p>
<p>Qatar beat Pacific Oceania 2-1</p>
<p>Results (Qatari names first):</p>
<p>Cesarito Diong lost to Motuliki Kailahi 7-6 (7-4), retired</p>
<p>Sultan Khalfan al-Alawi beat Lency Tenai 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>Sultan Khalfan al-Alawi/Nasser Ghanim al-Khelaifi beat Motuhki</p>
<p>Kailahi/Lency Tenai 2-6 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Kazakhstan beat Kuwait 3-0</p>
<p>Results (Kazakhstan names first):</p>
<p>Alexei Kedryuk beat Mohammad Rashid 3-0 retired</p>
<p>Igor Chaldounov beat Khalid al-Gharabally 6-3 0-40 retired.</p>
<p>Igor Chaldounov/Alexei Kedryuk beat Mohammad Rashid/Khalid</p>
<p>al-Gharabally, walkover</p>
<p>Final placings:</p>
<p>1. Qatar</p>
<p>2. Pacific Oceania</p>
<p>3. Kazakhstan</p>
<p>4. Kuwait</p>
<p>5. Malaysia</p>
<p>6. Sri Lanka</p>
<p>7. Bahrain</p>
<p>8. Bangladesh.</p>
<p>Promoted to Asia/Oceania group II (in 1998): Qatar,</p>
<p>Pacific Oceania</p>
<p>Relegated to Asia/Oceania group IV (in 1998): Bahrain,</p>
<p>Bangladesh.</p>
</text>
